    "detailed_description": "MEs is a new personal knowledge collection and network of multiplayer worlds \u2014 a multiplayer file system that visualizes your images, music, text, and 3D models as virtual worlds. Use them as materials to build your own worlds to play and share the visualization of your thinking.  <br><br><strong>STORY</strong><br>Explore the endless world of MEs and encounter art, data, memories, and unexpected &quot;artifacts.&quot; Exchange hearts and minds with others on your journey of encountering and re-exploring your own mental map. Play with the natural flow of your deep thoughts in ever-expanding constellations, while enhancing communications, growing relationships and building community.<br><br><strong>DEVELOPER NOTES</strong><br>MEs is still in very early stages of development, so we appreciate any and all forms of feedback! If you are interested in helping us test MEs, please follow the Discord link or sign up on our website from the information panel to right.",
